I'll come back, since you're busy.

726
00:35:01,830 --> 00:35:04,150
Au fait, Jacques m'a appelé.
By the way, Jacques called me.

727
00:35:04,350 --> 00:35:04,970
Jacques Audiard.
Jacques Audiard.

728
00:35:05,110 --> 00:35:06,930
Et il veut absolument que je lui présente des jeunes.
And he absolutely wants me to introduce him to some young people.

729
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:08,400
Audiard.
Audiard.

730
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,540
Il m'appelle tous les jours, quatre fois par jour.
He calls me every day, four times a day.

731
00:35:10,640 --> 00:35:11,180
J'en peux plus.
I can't take it anymore.

732
00:35:12,540 --> 00:35:12,820
Bref.
Anyway.

733
00:35:13,790 --> 00:35:15,330
Ça va, la négo du Cluzet, sinon ?
How's the Cluzet negotiation going, by the way?

734
00:35:15,330 --> 00:35:16,090
Ceux qu'on en parle ?
Should we talk about it?

735
00:35:16,090 --> 00:35:16,550
Non, ça va.
No, it's fine.

736
00:35:16,610 --> 00:35:17,130
Ils vont sortir.
They're going to settle.

737
00:35:19,100 --> 00:35:19,420
Excusez-moi.
Excuse me.

738
00:35:20,240 --> 00:35:20,800
Attendez, Mathias.
Wait, Mathias.

739
00:35:20,980 --> 00:35:22,520
Est-ce que vous auriez juste une minute ?
Could you spare just a minute?

740
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,000
On se connaît pas.
We don't know each other.

741
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:23,580
Moi, je vous connais.
I know you.

742
00:35:23,660 --> 00:35:25,160
Je vous avais envoyé un mail il y a un an.
I sent you an email a year ago.

743
00:35:25,160 --> 00:35:25,980
Avec des photos.
With photos.

744
00:35:26,160 --> 00:35:26,920
Des petits bouts de ma tête.
Little bits of my face.

745
00:35:27,460 --> 00:35:28,800
Et puis, comme je suis au théâtre...
And since I'm in theater...

746
00:35:31,540 --> 00:35:38,000
On a fait un pacte.
We made a pact.

747
00:35:38,020 --> 00:35:39,160
Il y a cinq mois, j'ai pas rêvé.
Five months ago, I didn't dream it.

748
00:35:39,620 --> 00:35:40,280
Tout à fait, ouais.
Absolutely, yeah.

749
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,620
On a longuement discuté.
We talked it over at length.

750
00:35:41,660 --> 00:35:42,460
On a bien réfléchi.
We thought it through carefully.

751
00:35:42,500 --> 00:35:43,180
On est tombés d'accord.
We came to an agreement.

752
00:35:43,660 --> 00:35:44,920
Tu as dit, ce jour-là,
You said, that day,

753
00:35:44,980 --> 00:35:47,020
que tu n'avais pas l'intention d'élever cet enfant
that you had no intention of raising this child

754
00:35:47,020 --> 00:35:48,900
et que tu resterais en retrait.
and that you would stay in the background.

755
00:35:49,340 --> 00:35:50,200
Ce qui était la condition
Which was the condition

756
00:35:50,200 --> 00:35:52,060
pour que Colette et moi, on garde ce bébé.
for Colette and me to keep this baby.

757
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:52,760
Exact.
Exactly.

758
00:35:53,620 --> 00:35:54,400
Mais alors, du coup,
But so then,

759
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,940
en retrait, c'est quoi que tu comprends pas ?
"in the background" — what part of that don't you get?

760
00:35:55,940 --> 00:35:57,000
En retrait ?
In the background?

761
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:58,480
Oh, on a dit aussi qu'on s'agressait pas.
Hey, we also said we wouldn't attack each other.

762
00:35:58,480 --> 00:36:00,060
Là, tu m'agresses, mais qu'est-ce que j'ai fait ?
You're attacking me right now — what did I do?

763
00:36:00,060 --> 00:36:01,260
Je suis en retrait, là ?
Am I not keeping my distance?

764
00:36:01,820 --> 00:36:02,380
Le berceau.
The crib.

765
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:03,800
Mais c'est un cadeau !
But it's a gift!

766
00:36:05,000 --> 00:36:06,900
Andrea, oh, si on peut même plus faire de cadeaux...
Andrea, oh, if we can't even give gifts anymore...

767
00:36:06,900 --> 00:36:07,760
Non, on peut pas !
No, we can't!

768
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,840
Ça brouille le pacte.
It muddies the pact.

769
00:36:09,340 --> 00:36:10,180
Ça stresse Colette.
It stresses Colette out.

770
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:11,080
Et du coup, ça me stresse.
And that stresses me out.

771
