mais les gros cadeaux, là,
but big gifts like this —

775
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:18,300
chers, luxueux,
expensive, lavish ones —

776
00:36:19,750 --> 00:36:20,310
ça étouffe.
it's suffocating.

777
