single people near you.

792
00:37:00,900 --> 00:37:01,860
Enfin, autour de toi, quoi.
Well, around you, you know.

793
00:37:02,620 --> 00:37:03,820
Je te crois pas, c'est pas possible.
I don't believe you, that can't be right.

794
