but his behavior has deteriorated too.

810
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:40,080
Dès que je lui demande quelque chose, il est odieux.
Whenever I ask him something, he's awful.

811
00:37:41,110 --> 00:37:42,710
Et surtout, il me dit qu'il va à des rendez-vous,
And above all, he tells me he has appointments,

812
