00:41:00,370 --> 00:41:00,850
Lâche ça !
Drop it!

890
00:41:00,850 --> 00:41:02,590
Lâche le manteau !
Drop the coat!

891
00:41:07,310 --> 00:41:09,380
Shrek !
Shrek!

892
00:41:10,060 --> 00:41:11,300
Shrek, attends-moi !
Shrek, wait for me!

893
